/*
 *  v3.80: A padlock on each picture. Locked, the generate button EDITS that
 *         picture through a separate Edit preset, changing only what the fields
 *         changed since it was drawn; one-step undo per picture.
 *  v3.77: A headless image call can name the preset to draw with, and the preset
 *         list is exposed — a gallery can be redrawn by an edit workflow.
 *  v3.76: A prompt that deliberately asks for a bulge keeps its words — the clothed
 *         filter used to delete the tag AND the trigger a size LoRA matches on.
 *  v3.75.1: Scrotum Size is twelve steps with something to hold each against.
 *  v3.75: NSFW gains the rest of the Futaverse hierarchy metrics — tier, semen
 *         reserve, ejaculation force, libido, stamina, recovery, lactation, milk,
 *         mutation, instinct control and trained extras.
 *  v3.74: createFromDraft can press the editor two buttons a headless caller could
 *         not: the raw stats block and Reconstruct Biography / History.
 *  v3.73: Headless image calls can bring their own prompt and reuse one LoRA pick,
 *         and ComfyUI is polled adaptively — a page of six portraits no longer pays
 *         twenty seconds of language model per four seconds of GPU.
 *  v3.72: Headless image calls can pin (and report) the workflow seed, so a caller
 *         that keeps a profile without its bitmap redraws the same face later.
 *  v3.71: Headless gallery images can use the approved portrait as an identity reference.
 *  v3.70: Headless character/location drafts and image generation for AI Discovery.
 *  v3.69: Quiet gate — narration contracts (system_prompt / post_history / depth_prompt)
 *         are muted in memory during 'quiet' generations, so other extensions'
 *         structured requests are no longer hijacked by narrator/location cards.
 *  v3.68: Open and edit an existing character sprite set in Review without batch generation.
 *  v3.67: Full SmartChromaKey tuning and quick matte presets in emotion review.
 *  v3.66: Chroma-key selector in the emotion review window.
 *  v3.65: Headless Character Library sprite generation with review/apply handoff.
 *  v3.64: Character Library may choose the number of variants per emotion through the public API.
 *  v3.63: Selectable green/magenta chroma-key prompts and SmartChromaKey for built-in emotion sprites.
 *  Character Creator — SillyTavern Extension (version: CC_VERSION below)
 *  Create character cards via LLM with simple & advanced modes,
 *  image generation via ComfyUI (AutoIllustrator integration),
 *  template loading, clothing system, field locking, translation.
 *
 *  v3.27: Audit fixes — sprite upload error reporting, portable-card scrub on all
 *         fields, no description/personality duplication, autosave, RU dictionary,
 *         ComfyUI interrupt on cancel, generateQuietPrompt signature detection.
 *  v3.6: Reconstruct Fields — extract structured attributes back out of an
 *        existing (loaded) character card via the LLM.
 *  v2.1: Added Emotions sprite generation for Character Expressions extension.
 *  Supports: Flux 2 Klein, Illustrious/NoobAI, SD 1.5, SDXL
 */

